  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att utveckla forskningskompetensen inom samh&#xE4;llsvetenskap (geografi, ekonomi och sociologi) genom ett sandwich PhD program och ett MSc program vid universitetet i Sri Jayewardenepura</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to expand the human resource development in the field of social sciences (Geography, economics and sociology) through a sandwich type PhD training and research and a locally conducted MSc program at the University of Sri Jayewardenepura</narrative>
